      "cause": "Success exit nativeCallbackResult does not run on invoke error. A callback captures actual fatal A; deferred constructible receiver retirement emits ordinary or fatal B; failFor/throwCaptured prioritizes current pending B over captured A. A real GPA error followed by Scope cleanup capturing current fatal B also leads raw OutOfMemory fail to synthesize C because captured history/current provenance is not isolated at this shared callback boundary.",
