      "cause": "last_error is retired/null before while(captured_exception). Retiring a sole-owned captured native value can run a finalizer that calls engine.checked(JS_Throw(...)), installing a new last_error and captured_exception. Outer while retires nested captured values but does not retire newly installed last_error before commit. Fatal outer leaves nested diagnostic stale; ordinary outer overwrites its owned pointer without freeing.",
      "required": "Detach/retire every actual reentrant diagnostic owner before final commit while selected first reason stays owned outside both slots. Preserve first-fatal precedence and balanced diagnostic suppression.",
